  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ceef6ac683113a4cbfb949895698a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cinematicScript: {fileID: 1544572712}
  uiScript: {fileID: 1544572716}
  FXscript: {fileID: 1544572713}
  isAbsolved: 0
  dialogueOver: 0
  confessedMurder: 0
  gloating: 0
  dialogue:
  - Are you ready to confess?
  - Enter when you are ready...
  - 
  - How long has it been since your last confession?
  - That is quite recent, what are your transgressions
  - "\u2026.Our conversation here is private, but you must understand I may have
    to tell authorities in some circumstances"
  - Have you considered moving away from such an occupation?
  - There are places for people like you to go, to be rehabilitated, retrained, dont
    give up. Tell me your sins
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - These things can be forgiven, both in the eyes of the law and the lord
  - and how do you feel about this, do you feel guilt? You come again and again and
    keep repeating your sins
  - I can see your intentions are true...please make your penance
  - I absolve you
  - Give thanks to the Lord, for he is good.
  - 
  - 
  dialogue2:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - And yet you are here.How long has it been since your last confession
  - Its never a bad time to start, you must have much to speak about
  - 
  - 
  - I see, well I can offer you little advice otherwise. State your sins in detail
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - "\u2026how many\u2026killed?"
  - You say you feel guilt, but you want to get back to it, you must mean it when
    you confess, its not just a facade.
  - I dont believe you truly mean it
  - ' I cannot absolve you, I''m sorry. May god be more merciful than me'
  - 
  - 
  - 
  dialogue3:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Please leave...
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 'You clearly Fell no Shame at all!! In fact you relish in it! '
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
