  PriestSpeech: {fileID: 2133986738}
  d: 0
  dLimit: 17
  dialogueObject: {fileID: 330166807}
  goodDialogue:
  - Yes
  - Bless me Father for I have sinned
  - 3 weeks
  - I live a life of crime, guilt quickly builds up
  - 'I understand father '
  - Its all ive ever known, I have no other skills and a huge rap sheet. I dont know
    where to go
  - "I confess that I have stolen\u2026"
  - and nothing else
  - and nothing else
  - and nothing else
  - I hope so father, all the stress eats away at me, I need to abandon this life
  - I see tortured visions every time, but Its unavoidable, I dont set out to kill,
    I just dont want to be locked up
  - ' "O God, be merciful to me, a sinner."'
  - Thank you
  - His mercy endures for ever.
  - 
  goodDialogue2:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - "More than I can count\u2026"
  - 
  - 
  - I understand, I just needed to get it off my chest
  - 
  - 
  gd: 0
  goodText: {fileID: 223442261}
  badDialogue:
  - No
  - "I don\u2019t believe in confession"
  - This is my first time
  - I live a life of crime, I could write you a novel.
  - Fuck no, I cant trust you, im leaving
  - I'm good at it, I make a lot of money from it, why would I stop
  - 
  - Trespassed
  - Decieved
  - Killed
  - I am not going to the law! I just need to absolve my guilt so I can get back
    to it
  - I just need to clear my head every now and then, so I can keep going, thats all
  - 
  - 
  - ...
  - 
  badDialogue2:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - well, I dont mean to brag but its probably close to 50
  - 
  - 
  - I did all of this for nothing?
  - Great Guilt Free!
  - 
